mpt:** I added a note to the packet's Executor log about the `gh` blocker and the human decision needed. I also added the packet's friction line to `.theseus/scoreboard/friction.jsonl`, which was missing, and committed both.\n\n**Lessons for the Atlas:**\n- Upstream history can be cloned with git even when `gh` is refused.\n- Euro-Office's history contains 1,828 duplicate commits. Deduplicate by date and subject before counting, or the counts nearly double.\n- `DocsCoServer.js` is the defect hotspot: about 27% of fix commits and 31% of crash fixes.\n- ONLYOFFICE has 7 crash fixes from 2026 whose subjects don't appear on Euro-Office's default branch. Whether they are actually missing still needs checking by content; `baseline.md` records this.\n- Rejections keep demanding something the executor isn't allowed to run. That mismatch between the goal and the permissions has to be settled before a packet is assigned.","ttft_ms":1577,"type":"result","duration_ms":24042,"uuid":"a8277d55-81a9-4440-8b49-18cad2cb2366","ttft_stream_ms":850,"time_to_request_ms":369,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":5,"system_prompt":218,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":5,"input_attachments":19,"input_hooks":3,"conversation_append":0,"transcript_persist":34,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":9,"init_frame_send":4,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":4,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":2,"request_announcements":14,"query_setup":4,"auto_mode_context_wait":7,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":21,"message_normalization":2,"client_creation":5,"request_build":10},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":58,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":194,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":215,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":140,"process_rss_mib_result":231,"process_anon_mib_result":141,"process_peak_rss_mib":260,"process_cpu_ms_turn":1338,"process_wall_ms_turn":24041,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":497,"process_wall_ms_streaming":19312